+ * They end in a musttail dispatch, so the chain still does not grow the C stack.
+ *
+ * The gate's frame check exempts these two by name for exactly that reason; the
+ * handlers themselves are frameless and are not exempt. See tools/regvm/gate.sh.
+ */
